{"4606900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Piywebler", "steam_appid": 4606900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE MAPS. THREE DIFFERENT NIGHTMARES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PIYWEBLER is a mission-based horror game that you can play alone or in online co-op with 1–4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three distinct maps, ranging from an abandoned hospital and a cursed carnival to a city shrouded in darkness. Different missions, creatures, dangers, and escape routes await you on each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the missions, work together with your teammates, and find the way out before the creatures catch you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARNIVAL — CATCH, POISON, FEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and catch the five pigs in the cursed carnival. Collect the toxic water, prepare the poison, and feed the pigs to the creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But while you hunt the pigs, the creature will be hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the monster… or you might become its next meal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >METROPOLIS — RESTORE THE POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this abandoned city, where the power has completely gone out, the subway is your only means of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the five batteries across the map, reactivate the power panels, and disable the robotic spiders with your UV light. Avoid the creature roaming the city and reach the exit before the subway departs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you do, don’t look back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOSPITAL — FIND THE PROTOCOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark floors of the abandoned hospital and find the five missing protocols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden power outages, dangerous traps, and the creature roaming the corridors will make every step more difficult. Not every object you interact with may be safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful. It is much closer than you think.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALONE OR WITH YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or form a team of up to four players. You can split up to complete the missions faster or stay together to increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you leave your teammates alone, you might become the creature’s next target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player and online co-op for 1–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three completely different horror maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different missions and escape methods on each map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map-specific creatures and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on teamwork and communication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power outages, traps, and unexpected events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, mission, and survival mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the missions. Reach the exit. Survive the nightmare.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THREE MAPS. THREE DIFFERENT NIGHTMARES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PIYWEBLER is a mission-based horror game that you can play alone or in online co-op with 1–4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore three distinct maps, ranging from an abandoned hospital and a cursed carnival to a city shrouded in darkness. Different missions, creatures, dangers, and escape routes await you on each map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the missions, work together with your teammates, and find the way out before the creatures catch you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CARNIVAL — CATCH, POISON, FEED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and catch the five pigs in the cursed carnival. Collect the toxic water, prepare the poison, and feed the pigs to the creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But while you hunt the pigs, the creature will be hunting you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the monster… or you might become its next meal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >METROPOLIS — RESTORE THE POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this abandoned city, where the power has completely gone out, the subway is your only means of escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the five batteries across the map, reactivate the power panels, and disable the robotic spiders with your UV light. Avoid the creature roaming the city and reach the exit before the subway departs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whatever you do, don’t look back.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HOSPITAL — FIND THE PROTOCOLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the dark floors of the abandoned hospital and find the five missing protocols.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sudden power outages, dangerous traps, and the creature roaming the corridors will make every step more difficult. Not every object you interact with may be safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful. It is much closer than you think.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALONE OR WITH YOUR FRIENDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or form a team of up to four players. You can split up to complete the missions faster or stay together to increase your chances of survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you leave your teammates alone, you might become the creature’s next target.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player and online co-op for 1–4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three completely different horror maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different missions and escape methods on each map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map-specific creatures and dangers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay focused on teamwork and communication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power outages, traps, and unexpected events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration, mission, and survival mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the missions. Reach the exit. Survive the nightmare.</p>", "short_description": "Step into nightmares with your team or on your own. In a 1–4 player online co-op experience, complete missions, escape deadly creatures, and find your way out before it’s too late. Different missions, dangers, and escape methods await you on every map.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Danish, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Greek, Czech, Swedish, Dutch", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606900/5bf0abd805677942dae66a3881994567469ea686/header.jpg?t=1785948580", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606900/b8de1946f5d5397b0c6474ee7b69d08a70623509/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785948580", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4606900/b8de1946f5d5397b0c6474ee7b69d08a70623509/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785948580", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-